The Mercedes-Benz Vito 114 CDI is part of the W447 generation (2014-present), which received a significant update in 2019/2020 and further tweaks in 2024. The 114 CDI variant typically features a 2.0L or 2.1L 4-cylinder turbo-diesel engine producing 100 kW (134 hp) and 330 Nm of torque. It is commonly available with rear-wheel drive, and transmission options include a 6-speed manual or a 7-speed or 9-speed automatic (7G-Tronic Plus or 9G-Tronic). It is offered in various lengths and body styles, including panel van, crew cab (Mixto), and passenger vehicle (Tourer), with seating for up to 9 people in the Tourer.

